---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Zhang Rental Management SMS Consent"
  description="How to opt in to Zhang Rental Management's non-marketing property operations SMS support."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 3rem; max-width: 820px;">
    <span class="eyebrow">Zhang Rental Management</span>
    <h1>SMS Consent</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      <strong>Zhang Rental Management</strong> uses automated text messages
      for non-marketing property operations support for existing residential
      tenants and service vendors. This includes maintenance and repairs,
      appointment coordination, lease or parking questions, and vendor
      scheduling.
    </p>

    <h2>How to Opt In</h2>
    <p>
      An existing tenant or service vendor opts in by reviewing this public
      notice, then personally texting <strong>START</strong> to
      <strong>+1 (630) 407-1314</strong>. By sending START, the person agrees
      to receive recurring transactional text messages from Zhang Rental
      Management about their property support or service coordination. START
      is the only opt-in method for this program. Consent is not a condition of
      renting or receiving property management services.
    </p>
    <p>
      Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. This program
      does not send marketing or promotional messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Sample Confirmation</h2>
    <p>
      Zhang Rental Management: You are subscribed to recurring property
      operations messages. Msg frequency varies. Msg &amp; data rates may apply.
      Reply HELP for help or STOP to cancel.
    </p>

    <h2>Help and Opt Out</h2>
    <p>
      Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance. Reply <strong>STOP</strong>
      to stop receiving messages. Reply <strong>START</strong> to subscribe
      again after opting out.
    </p>
    <p>
      Sending START records the subscription request. Ordinary property
      operations messages are limited to contacts with an existing tenant or
      service relationship; sending START does not create such a relationship.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy and Terms</h2>
    <p>
      Read the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> and
      <a href="/terms/">SMS Terms and Conditions</a> before opting in. SMS
      opt-in data and consent are not shared with third parties or affiliates
      for marketing or promotional purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For support or questions about this program, email
      <a href="mailto:luzhang@sciencesloop.com">luzhang@sciencesloop.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
